# git tracks only the process — comic data is reproducible from a source
# folder: place "<comic>/" at the repo root, then upscale -> compose ->
# detect -> sheets -> transcribe -> merge -> fit -> gimp pass -> qa -> merge.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/ARCHITECTURE.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/README.md
!/justfile
!/process.py
!/template.xcf
!/template_geometry.json
!/gimp-plugin/
!/relettering/
/relettering/*
!/relettering/*.py
# comic fonts are licensed material: the user supplies them locally —
# see relettering/fonts/README.md (only the instructions are tracked)
!/relettering/fonts/
/relettering/fonts/*
!/relettering/fonts/README.md
